  "details": "Description\n\nThe VRChat Home world's music playlist does not play any audio at all, or apparently load music at all. The title bar permanently reads \"Song name - artist\". Its buttons do nothing.\n\nThis has persisted through reinstalling the game, across different platforms (Windows AND Linux), and any lineup of settings I can think of. Music works fine anywhere else.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLaunch the VRChat Home world. It's the latest version of said world.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None) <- Untrue. I'm on Bazzite w/ Proton Experimental, but it occurs on Windows too.\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1885-81193b80fa-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\nLogs (Windows/Linux) available on request.",
